  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 760359,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1st Work: Conquer the English Football League!\n\nStep into the boots of a manager in *1st Work*, the definitive football management simulation for the Commodore 64! Choose your club from the top four English leagues and embark on a thrilling journey to glory.  \n\nExperience the pressure of guiding your team to victory, meticulously crafting tactics, and nurturing young talent.  Each match delivers intense on-field action, followed by detailed post-match reports.  Scour injury lists, analyze rival results, and carefully manage your club's finances to ensure long-term success. \n\nWill you build a dynasty, unearthing future stars and dominating your rivals? Or will financial woes and crippling injuries derail your ambitions?  *1st Work* offers a deep and rewarding management experience, demanding strategic thinking and shrewd decision-making.  From youth development to transfer negotiations, every choice matters.  Can you lead your team to the Premier League title and European glory? The fate of your club rests in your hands!"
    },
